        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "• Upgrades in Field Service and Distribution – Any employee who goes to school at the training center for an upgrading in the Field Service Operations or Distribution Operations Departments will be placed on advanced assignment except the employees who are on loan for the entry level position in said department.",
