        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) Job Vacancy Location List – When the Company finds that such need exists, it shall furnish the Union a list showing the location of such job vacancy, the employees in the classification from which advancements will be made, and the departmental seniority of such employees. See Filling Vacancies, Article XI, also see Letter of Agreements.",
